5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,680
1943 is missing.

6
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,000
That year copper went to the

7
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:19,120
war, and the cent was struck in steel.

8
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:24,480
1944. At Bretton Woods, forty-four nations

9
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:26,560
