16
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,120
Then dimes and quarters lose their silver. 1971.

17
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,400
The dollar can no longer be exchanged for gold.

18
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:56,640
US currency becomes fiat.

19
00:00:57,110 --> 00:00:59,510
Material is detached from value,

20
00:00:59,550 --> 00:01:01,590
and the effects reach far beyond currency

21
00:01:01,670 --> 00:01:03,910
alone into humanity's fundamental

22
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:08,350
