23
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:10,910
Inflation runs in double digits.

24
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:15,310
Rutherford Chang is born. 1982.

25
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:18,030
Copper has grown too costly for the cent,

26
00:01:18,110 --> 00:01:18,910
and partway through the

27
00:01:18,990 --> 00:01:21,230
year the Mint switches to zinc.

28
00:01:21,470 --> 00:01:22,990
The collection stops there.

29
00:01:24,094 --> 00:01:26,830
In the Block, the dates are gone:

30
00:01:26,910 --> 00:01:31,550
1910 and 1982 are the same indeterminate mass.

31
00:01:31,790 --> 00:01:34,350
As inscriptions, the value and the meaning of

32
00:01:34,670 --> 00:01:37,150
